{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43523","headline":"五言夜宴咏灯联句 · 颜真卿","name":"五言夜宴咏灯联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂酒牵诗兴，兰釭照客情。\n讵慙珠乘朗，不让月轮明。\n破暗光初白，浮云色转清。\n带花疑在树，比燎欲分庭。\n顾己慙微照，开帘识近汀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}